    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- Update to 1.50.6:
  * GHSA-2gr5-vw2p-2hcf: stored DOM-XSS via unescaped group-node
    and subgraph names in node search (fixed in 1.50.2)
  * GHSA-j6xv-rx8r-mh6j: stored DOM-XSS via unescaped node
    property names in the litegraph Properties dialog
    (fixed in 1.50.4)
  * GHSA-8xxc-66vh-2pf3: cloud Open Image same-origin XSS via
    attacker-controlled Content-Type (fixed in 1.50.5; first
    PyPI release that contains the fix)
  * First-run onboarding tour with canvas coachmarks and
    template hand-off
  * Asset filter search; image compositor node with a
    PSD-style layer editor
  * Show backend-submitted node display names in English
  * Import A1111 PNGs that have no negative prompt
  * Build nodes for uninstalled types on API JSON import
  * Show dynamic combo inputs in the node info panel
  * Batch WebSocket progress events
  * Open popular templates for new users; stop relaying
    Desktop execution starts to the frontend

PyPI sdist. INTERDEPENDENT: please stage together with the
comfyui Requires pin bump to 1.50.6 (otherwise Factory
installcheck leaves comfyui unresolvable: it currently
Requires python-comfyui-frontend-package = 1.49.6).</comment>
